+// REWINDBOX_SPU_PREFETCH_AC_634: Assassin's Creed reads 4,000 objects from the disk in its first
+// minute on the Build 629 logs, 0.4 to 0.7 ms each and 7 ms for the first after an idle period;
+// Black Ops II reads the same size of object in 0.02 ms from this prefetch. The SPU Object Prefetch
+// setting tests each mode per game.
+constexpr bool requires_spu_object_prefetch(std::string_view title_id) noexcept
+{
